= Worked Solutions

Solutions to every exercise, worked rather than merely stated.

#warning(title: "read these second")[
  A solution read before a genuine attempt produces the *feeling* of
  understanding without any of the substance. Give each problem fifteen real
  minutes first.

  When you do come here and find you were wrong, the useful step is not
  reading the solution --- it is finding the specific sentence in the chapter
  you failed to use. That is the thing that will not happen again.
]

Solutions are numbered to match the exercises: solution 14.3 answers exercise
3 of Chapter 14.

